PolicydSPF - ChangeLog
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 1.3.0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Ported to Debian 13 (Trixie): Postfix 3.10, postfix-policyd-spf-python 3.1.0 (python3), Perl 5.40, PHP 7.3
    Requires i-MSCP >= 1.5.4 (plugin API 1.5.1)
    Changed: Switch from postfix-policyd-spf-perl to postfix-policyd-spf-python (/usr/bin/policyd-spf), as
             recommended by Debian (RFC 7208 support, configurable through
             /etc/postfix-policyd-spf-python/policyd-spf.conf). The postfix-policyd-spf-perl package is no longer
             installed (it is not removed if already installed)
    Changed: Default policy service renamed to unix:private/policyd-spf (Debian default); the spawn(8) service now
             runs as the dedicated policyd-spf user (was nobody), with process limit 0 (as documented by Debian)
    Changed: The master.cf service name and the <name>_time_limit parameter are derived from the
             `policyd_spf_service' parameter
    Added: `policyd_spf_user' parameter
    Fixed: <service>_time_limit parameter not removed/set reliably (POSTCONF(1) doesn't list service-derived
           parameters for unknown services); legacy policy-spf_time_limit parameter is removed
    Fixed: Restriction of previous configuration not removed when the service is changed
    Fixed: Configuration parameters are validated (values end in Postfix configuration files)

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 1.2.0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Enhancement: Automatically install distribution packages
    Removed: Support for i-MSCP 1.3.x Serie

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 1.1.0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Fixed: postconf -X command not available in Postfix versions < 2.10
    Updated for i-MSCP 1.3.x Serie

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 1.0.0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    First release
